  "details": "The standard validation log column and the Performance Rank evaluation column should be displayed separately.\n\nThe VRCSDK control panel currently displays Error, Warning, and Information logs in the Validations column, but the SDK for Avatar also displays the results of the performance rating in the same column, partly because the Very Poor icon is similar to the Error icon. This can be confusing, especially for users new to the VRCSDK.\n\nTranslated with www.DeepL.com/Translator (free version)",
